sequenceDiagram
    actor Receptionist
    participant Web as Web app
    participant API
    participant Svc as Appointments<br/>Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Receptionist->>Web: Pick patient, doctor, date and time, duration
    Web->>API: POST /appointments/validate after 500 ms pause
    API->>Svc: validate
    Svc->>DB: doctor active and assigned here, weekly hours, overlaps, daily count
    DB-->>Svc: rows
    Svc-->>Web: valid, or reason plus suggested start
    Web-->>Receptionist: Green "Time slot is available" or red reason with Apply
    Receptionist->>Web: Create Appointment
    Web->>API: POST /appointments
    API->>Svc: create, same checks again
    Svc->>DB: INSERT appointments with status scheduled
    alt overlapping live booking for this doctor
        DB-->>Svc: 23P01 from no_doctor_overlap
        Svc-->>Web: 409 DOCTOR_DOUBLE_BOOKED
    else saved
        DB-->>Svc: new row
        Svc-->>Web: 201 with the appointment
        Web-->>Receptionist: Toast and calendar jumps to the booked day
    end
